<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Oct 23.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Oct 23.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>No milling wheat 11 pct protein Liverpool Apr/Jun 127.00.</p>
<p>Southampton Oct 119.00.</p>
<p>Feed wheat Cheshire/Shropshire Nov 97.00 Dec 98.00.</p>
<p>Avonmouth Oct 99.00 Nov 99.50.</p>
<p>Feed barley to Avonmouth Nov 102.00.</p>
</text>
